{
  "s1": {
    "duration": 10.037,
    "sentences": 2,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 2.633,
        "text": "A ship stuck outside a port on Monday can"
      },
      {
        "start": 2.633,
        "end": 5.587,
        "text": "leave a hospital without insulin by Wednesday."
      },
      {
        "start": 5.807,
        "end": 8.224,
        "text": "The chain between those two facts is"
      },
      {
        "start": 8.224,
        "end": 10.037,
        "text": "invisible, until it breaks."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s2": {
    "duration": 13.765,
    "sentences": 3,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 2.988,
        "text": "Large distributors run planning suites that"
      },
      {
        "start": 2.988,
        "end": 3.752,
        "text": "model this."
      },
      {
        "start": 3.972,
        "end": 6.797,
        "text": "Everyone else finds out when a customer calls"
      },
      {
        "start": 6.797,
        "end": 9.057,
        "text": "about a delivery that never arrived."
      },
      {
        "start": 9.277,
        "end": 12.091,
        "text": "This is a regional medical supply network,"
      },
      {
        "start": 12.091,
        "end": 13.765,
        "text": "running an ordinary week."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s3": {
    "duration": 14.348,
    "sentences": 4,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 1.377,
        "text": "So break one link."
      },
      {
        "start": 1.597,
        "end": 4.568,
        "text": "Close the port, shut a hub, close a bridge, or"
      },
      {
        "start": 4.568,
        "end": 5.537,
        "text": "cut a supplier."
      },
      {
        "start": 5.757,
        "end": 8.293,
        "text": "Choose how long it lasts, and watch it hit."
      },
      {
        "start": 8.513,
        "end": 10.973,
        "text": "The clock stops, the shock spreads out from"
      },
      {
        "start": 10.973,
        "end": 13.604,
        "text": "the terminal, and every route that depended on"
      },
      {
        "start": 13.604,
        "end": 14.348,
        "text": "it turns red."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s4": {
    "duration": 21.52,
    "sentences": 8,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 2.638,
        "text": "Then it tells you what doing nothing costs."
      },
      {
        "start": 2.858,
        "end": 5.657,
        "text": "Twenty two orders late, out of seventy."
      },
      {
        "start": 5.877,
        "end": 8.023,
        "text": "Eleven of them for hospitals."
      },
      {
        "start": 8.243,
        "end": 10.035,
        "text": "Five days to recover."
      },
      {
        "start": 10.255,
        "end": 12.15,
        "text": "Sixty four thousand dollars."
      },
      {
        "start": 12.37,
        "end": 14.772,
        "text": "And it names the casualties in order."
      },
      {
        "start": 14.992,
        "end": 18.079,
        "text": "Day two, Central Hub runs out of insulin."
      },
      {
        "start": 18.299,
        "end": 21.125,
        "text": "Day three, Saint Clara Hospital gets a late"
      },
      {
        "start": 21.125,
        "end": 21.52,
        "text": "order."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s5": {
    "duration": 30.183,
    "sentences": 7,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 1.902,
        "text": "Now the planner goes to work."
      },
      {
        "start": 2.122,
        "end": 3.731,
        "text": "This is not a chatbot."
      },
      {
        "start": 3.95,
        "end": 6.679,
        "text": "It is a simulation based planning agent."
      },
      {
        "start": 6.899,
        "end": 9.809,
        "text": "It takes every combination of four recovery"
      },
      {
        "start": 9.809,
        "end": 12.719,
        "text": "levers, and plays each one out across forty"
      },
      {
        "start": 12.719,
        "end": 15.425,
        "text": "randomised futures, where demand, travel"
      },
      {
        "start": 15.425,
        "end": 18.335,
        "text": "times, and the disruption's real length all"
      },
      {
        "start": 18.335,
        "end": 18.673,
        "text": "vary."
      },
      {
        "start": 18.893,
        "end": 22.084,
        "text": "Green means every hospital order arrived on"
      },
      {
        "start": 22.084,
        "end": 22.455,
        "text": "time."
      },
      {
        "start": 22.675,
        "end": 25.477,
        "text": "Three hundred and twenty eight simulations, in"
      },
      {
        "start": 25.477,
        "end": 27.425,
        "text": "under a second, in your browser."
      },
      {
        "start": 27.645,
        "end": 30.183,
        "text": "Slowed down here, so you can watch it think."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s6": {
    "duration": 25.245,
    "sentences": 7,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 2.45,
        "text": "Then it picks one, and it shows its work."
      },
      {
        "start": 2.67,
        "end": 5.353,
        "text": "Twenty two late orders become three."
      },
      {
        "start": 5.573,
        "end": 8.482,
        "text": "Eleven late hospital orders become none."
      },
      {
        "start": 8.703,
        "end": 11.396,
        "text": "Sixty four thousand dollars becomes twenty"
      },
      {
        "start": 11.396,
        "end": 11.78,
        "text": "eight."
      },
      {
        "start": 12,
        "end": 14.276,
        "text": "And here is the part that matters."
      },
      {
        "start": 14.496,
        "end": 16.997,
        "text": "Another plan had zero late orders in the"
      },
      {
        "start": 16.997,
        "end": 19.749,
        "text": "expected week, better than the one it chose."
      },
      {
        "start": 19.969,
        "end": 23.053,
        "text": "It rejected it anyway, because in nineteen of"
      },
      {
        "start": 23.053,
        "end": 25.245,
        "text": "forty futures, a hospital waits."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s7": {
    "duration": 16.511,
    "sentences": 4,
    "cues": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 2.784,
        "text": "Apply it, and the week replays from the moment"
      },
      {
        "start": 2.784,
        "end": 3.934,
        "text": "the disruption hit."
      },
      {
        "start": 4.154,
        "end": 6.325,
        "text": "Green is the plan in action."
      },
      {
        "start": 6.545,
        "end": 9.258,
        "text": "Rush orders and spare stock, moving to where"
      },
      {
        "start": 9.258,
        "end": 10.183,
        "text": "they're needed."
      },
      {
        "start": 10.403,
        "end": 13.213,
        "text": "The hubs hold, the hospitals stay on schedule,"
      },
      {
        "start": 13.213,
        "end": 16.023,
        "text": "and it keeps score against doing nothing, hour"
      },
      {
        "start": 16.023,
        "end": 16.511,
        "text": "by hour."
      }
    ]
  },
  "s8": {
    "duration": 9.952,
    "sentences": 4,
    "cues": [
